WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.546
Actual local console session with synthetic records.

00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:07.016
These counts come from records in the isolated workspace.

00:00:07.016 --> 00:00:10.376
Each service identity has its own set of tool grants.

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:13.650
The policy revision binds a rule change to the recorded version.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.893
A sensitive action waits for an independent reviewer.

00:00:16.893 --> 00:00:20.089
Monitoring links each recorded run to its events.

00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:23.333
The directory is scoped to this synthetic organization.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:27.085
Reports can be inspected and exported for a single run.

00:00:27.085 --> 00:00:30.667
The Arabic view preserves the selected workspace.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:34.667
Project by Meshal Almasoudi & Fahad Mubarak.
